 from ₹ 2.04 Cr depending on BHK configuration in Malabar Hill Mumbai. \n*   ### What is the price range to buy a 2 BHK flat in Malabar Hill?\n\nThe price of 2 BHK apartments in Malabar Hill is between ₹ 3.38 Cr - ₹ 9.11 Cr. \n*   ### What are the average prices for 3 BHK flats in Malabar Hill?\n\nThe average price of 3 BHK flats in Malabar Hill is priced between ₹ 5.89 Cr - ₹ 37.58 Cr. \n\nAbout Magicbricks\n\nMagicbricks, India's leading real estate ecosystem, brings together everything consumers need to navigate their real estate journey with confidence. With 2M+ property listings and trusted market intelligence, we help consumers discover, evaluate and make informed property decisions.\n\nFrom property search and locality insights to AI-powered valuation through PropWorth, home loans, interiors and other home services, Magicbricks offers an integrated suite of solutions that supports consumers at every stage of their real estate journey.\n\nTrusted by millions. Powered by technology. Built on 20+ years of real estate expertise.\n\n*   [](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.timesgroup.magicbricks&referrer=utm_source=MobileAppBanner)\n*   [](https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/magicbricks/id486328406?ls=1&mt=8&referrer=utm_source=MobileAppBanner)\n*   [](https://www.facebook.com/magicbricks \"Facebook\")\n*   [](https://twitter.com/magicbricks \"Twitter\")\n*   [](https://in.linkedin.com/company/magicbricks \"Linkedin\")\n*   [](https://www.youtube.com/user/magicbricksvideo \"youtube MBTV\")\n*   [](https://www.instagram.com/magicbricks_official/ \"Instagram\")\n\nProperties in India\n\n*   [Property in New Delhi](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-new-delhi-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Chennai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-chennai-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Pune](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-pune-pppfs)\n*   [Property 