agicbricks.com/advertise-with-us)\n*   [News](https://www.magicbricks.com/news/)\n\nDisclaimer: Magicbricks Realty Services Limited is only an intermediary offering its platform to advertise properties of Seller for a Customer/Buyer/User coming on its Website and is not and cannot be a party to or privy to or control in any manner any transactions between the Seller and the Customer/Buyer/User. All the offers and discounts on this Website have been extended by Read more various Builder(s)/Developer(s) who have advertised their products. Magicbricks is only communicating the offers and not selling or rendering any of those products or services. It neither warrants nor is it making any representations with respect to offer(s) made on the site. Magicbricks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/6-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-south-mumbai-ffid","title":"6+ 6 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - 99acres.com","raw_content":"![Logo](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/nnares_logo_white_v2.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/mic.png)\n\n# 6 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/city_insights_map.png)\n![Rera-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/rera.png)\n![No-Brokerage-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/NBZ.png)\n![3D-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/d3.png)\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![PROJECT-IMAGE](https://newprojects.99acres.com/projects/dhuleva_infrastructures_llp/seven_dhuleva/images/svwwezq_1734773703_540176395_med.jpg)\n\n## 6 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nBeautiful 4,6 BHK apartments in Malabar Hill, are now available in Seven Dhuleva housing project. This society offers apartments in the price range of Rs. 13.9 - 27.89 Cr. Seven Dhuleva apartments are available in multiples sizes, ranging from 2,449 - 4,913 sqft CARPET area. Seven Dhuleva 's RERA registration number is P51900052793\n\n![Download-Icon](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/download_24px.svg)\n![Rera-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/rera.png)\n![No-Brokerage-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/NBZ.png)\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![PROJECT-IMAGE](https://newprojects.99acres.com/projects/runwal_realty/runwal_malabar/images/unabvxb_1775538598_739033644_med.jpg)\n\n## 6 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nRunwal Malabar has 3 BHK Apartment, 6 BHK Apartment and 1 BHK Studio Apartment options to offer in Malabar Hill. Runwal Malabar possession will begin from Jun, 2032. Properties in Runwal Malabar are sized in the range of 1,076 - 5,103 sqft. Prices here start from Rs. 15.05 Cr\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 6 BHK Flat in Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nFor sale: Ultra-Luxurious 6 bhk duplex in walkeshwar Ready to move | carpet area: 5,500 sq. Ft. | 6 car parks\\* Presenting an exclusive opportunity to own a one-Of-A-Kind duplex residence in the heart of south mumbai. This lavish 6 bhk home offers: Expansive 5,500 sq. Ft. Carpet area Breathtaking panoramic views of the arabian sea and marine drive 6 dedicated car parking spaces Premium specifica...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 6 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis 6 bhk apartment is available for sale in on request, one of the most prominent projects for flats in malabar hill, mumbai south. The flat is north-East-Facing. The flat is over 5200 sq.Ft. Super built up area and comes with 6 bedroom(s), 8 bathrooms and 3 balconies. The property is located on the 5th floor of a 7 floors tall building. Being a ready to move project, you can expect immediate...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 6 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe manor Location - Babulnath, 1st lane - Opposite 36 babulnath Total storeys - 13 Typology - 4bhk small (2300 rera carpet) 4bhk large (3000 rera carpet) 5/6bhk (5300 rera carpet) Penthouse (10,600 rera carpet ) Views - Unobstructed sea view along with the views of hanging garden Project highlights: \\* deck in each apartment \\* large private entrance lobby with each apartment \\* large windows/dec...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 6 BHK Flat in Napean Sea Road, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nWelcome to a location where your day is guided by the beat of the ocean. Where mother natures natural luxury meets the highest luxury man has ever made. A modern tower created for a blissful life, kalpataru azuro offers the best in seafront living. These magnificent 4 bhk residences were built with the highest attention to detail for fourteen outstanding families. A life spent here is a unique ...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![NO-IMAGE](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Tardeo, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nElite crest is one of the most popular destination for buying apartments/ flats in tardeo, mumbai south. You too can be a part of this society by purchasing this 2 bhk flat here. The flat is facing the south-West direction. The flat is over 92 sq.M. Carpet area and comes with 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies. The property is located on the 3rd floor of a 23 floors tall building. Being ...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![NO-IMAGE](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg)\n\n## 3 BHK Flat in Worli, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nLocated in the popular residential address of worli, mumbai south, neelkanth apartment is one of the most preferred destination for apartments in mumbai south. This 3 bhk flat is your ticket to be a part of this community. This is a south-West-Facing property. Constructed on a built up area of 1650 sq.Ft., the flat comprises 3 bedroom(s), 3 bathrooms and 2 balconies. The residential building ha...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat in Prabhadevi, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nSituated in prabhadevi, mumbai south, the wadhwa the address by the bay is a well planned society that offers a pleasant living experience to its residents. This 3 bhk flat in mumbai south is your opportunity to be a part of this community. This residential flat is south-West-Facing direction. Containing 3 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms and 1 balcony, this flat is spread over a super built up area of ...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat in Lower Parel, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis 3 bhk apartment is available for sale in arihant towers by mj shah, one of the most prominent projects for flats in lower parel, mumbai south. The flat is facing the south-West direction. The floor plan additionally contains 3 bedroom(s), 3 bathrooms and 2 balconies. All in all, the flat is spread over a carpet area of 1215 sq.Ft. This flat is situated on the 10th floor of this 32 floors t...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis residential flat is east-Facing direction. The floor plan additionally contains 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . All in all, the flat is spread over a carpet area of 667 sq.Ft. This flat is situated on the 14th floor of this 22 floors tall residential building. This 0-1 year old property is available for immediate possession as the project is ready to move. The flat comes well built with marble...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is east-Facing. The floor plan additionally contains 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . All in all, the flat is spread over a carpet area of 650 sq.Ft. This flat lies on the 26th level of a 39 storey building. As the property is currently under construction , you can expect to get the possession by may 2028. The marble flooring of this flat is beautifully designed and helps to give it a pleas...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe floor plan additionally contains 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . All in all, the flat is spread over a built up area of 600 sq.Ft. This flat lies on the ground level of a 1 storey building. As the project is already ready to move, so you can easily move into this 0-1 year old property.\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis 2bhk has 125 sq ft usable extension and situated very close to d n nagar metro junction and well connected with bus station going to all over mumbai city.\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\n2bathrooms 2