![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis tiger floor and open view .Constructed on a carpet area of 494 sq.Ft., the flat comprises 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies. The residential building has 36 floors in total and the flat for sale is located on the 29th floor. This residential flat is currently under construction and you can expect the possession of the same immediately.\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is east-Facing. The flat is over 650 sq.Ft. Carpet area and comes with 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . The property is located on the 14th floor of a 22 floors tall building. Moreover, the flat is currently under construction and possession is expected within 6 months. The well built marble flooring enhances the aesthetic appeal of this flat. The society complex is in the close vicinity of...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n![Green-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/StarNew.png)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis is a west-Facing property. The flat occupies a carpet area of 579 sq.Ft. That consists of 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms . This flat is situated on the 11th floor of this 46 floors tall residential building. Being a ready to move project, you can expect immediate possession of this 1-5 years old property. The vitrified flooring of this flat is beautifully designed and helps to give it a pleasing ...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is facing the east direction. Constructed on a super built up area of 700 sq.Ft., the flat comprises 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . The flat has a total of 22 floors and this property is situated on 16th floor. As the property is currently under construction , you can expect to get the possession within 6 months. The floor of this flat is beautifully designed using vitrified flooring, giv...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nIt's price and affordability in andheri west\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/voulmeOff.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is facing the east direction. The flat is over 917 sq.Ft. Super built up area and comes with 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . The property is located on the 8th floor of a 15 floors tall building. An added advantage of this 0-1 year old flat is that it is available for immediate possession as the project is already ready to move. The flat comes well built with marble flooring options. This ...\n\n![99acres](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/projectnoimage.webp \"99acres\")\n![FD-Badge](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/FDbadge.png)\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is south-West-Facing. Containing 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms and 3 balconies, this flat is spread over a carpet area of 778 sq.Ft. The residential building has 12 floors in total and the flat for sale is located on the 9th floor. The flat is currently under construction stage and you can expect to get the possession of the property immediately. Mesacon sohag is designed very well to prov...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat in Lower Parel, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nShilpa tower is one of mumbai south's most sought after destination for apartments and this 3 bhk flat in lower parel is your opportunity to be a part of this community. This property faces the south-West direction. The flat is over 948 sq.Ft. Carpet area and comes with 3 bedroom(s), 3 bathrooms and 2 balconies. The residential building has 55 floors in total and the flat for sale is located on...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Shivaji Park, Dadar\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nCheck out this 2 bhk apartment for sale in godrej la vista, a popular residential project that houses in-Demand flats in shivaji park, mumbai south. The flat is south-West-Facing. The flat is over 1245 sq.Ft. Built up area and comes with 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms and 2 balconies. The flat has a total of 16 floors and this property is situated on 13th floor. This 1-5 years old property is availa...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis is a east-Facing property. The flat occupies a carpet area of 659 sq.Ft. That consists of 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms . The flat has a total of 22 floors and this property is situated on 9th floor. Moreover, the flat is currently under construction and possession is expected by december 2027. The vitrified flooring of this flat is beautifully designed and helps to give it a pleasing look. Anot...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nCheck out this 2 bhk apartment for sale in sunteck city avenue 4, a popular residential project that houses in-Demand flats in goregaon west, mumbai andheri-Dahisar. The flat is over 645 sq.Ft. Carpet area and comes with 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . This flat is situated on the 1st floor of this 46 floors tall residential building. Moreover, the flat is currently under construction and possessio...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Juhu, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nWe are the proud owners of this 2 bhk apartment available in sweet home mumbai, juhu, western mumbai. This semi-Furnished apartment it is a and the unit is located on 1st floor and has a built up area of 800 sq.Ft. . It has 2 bathroom(s) and 1 balcony(s). The unit is located in a co-Operative society.\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/voulmeOff.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is facing the east direction. Containing 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms , this flat is spread over a super built up area of 650 sq.Ft. The residential building has 17 floors in total and the flat for sale is located on the 16th floor. This is a ready to move project and the property is 0-1 year old. The vitrified flooring of this flat is beautifully designed and helps to give it a pleasing ...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/voulmeOff.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nSpacious 1.5bhk unfurnished flat available for sale in the prime location of andheri west. Smartly designed layout with an additional room ideal for study, office, or small bedroom. Well-Ventilated home with good natural light, allowing customization as per your preference. Located in a well-Connected area close to metro, railway station, schools, and daily essentials. Perfect for end-Users and...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe property is located in a very good area with parks nearby and it is vastu complaint and east facing\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/voulmeOff.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nPremium 1.5 bhk for sale\nChandiwala pearl regency\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nPrime connectivity just 200 meters from azad nagar metro station\nRooftop terrace with landscaped gardens, walkway, and lounge seating\nAdvanced automated tower parking with integrated ev charging stations\nSecure living with biometric access and app-Based visitor management\nSenior and disabled-Friendly design with dedicated access ramps\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Andheri West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nWell-Lit rooms with large windows and plenty of natural sunlight. Prime andheri west location One of the biggest selling points is the address: Kush sapphire, mathur pada, ambivali, andheri west. This location offers: Excellent connectivity to link road, sv road, and western express highway. Close to andheri and jogeshwari railway stations. Easy access to metro connectivity. Surrounded by schoo...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nTown ashtha heights is one of the most popular destination for buying apartments/ flats in goregaon west, western mumbai. You too can be a part of this society by purchasing this 2 bhk flat here. This is a south-West-Facing property. The flat occupies a carpet area of 656 sq.Ft. That consists of 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and 1 balcony. This flat lies on the 8th level of a 21 storey building. Bein...\n\n## 6 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill, Mumbai for Sale\n\n### BHK-wise Flats in Malabar Hill\n\n### New Launch Projects in Malabar Hill\n\n### Under Construction Projects in Malabar Hill\n\n### Ready to Move Projects in Malabar Hill\n\n### Nearby Localities in Malabar Hill\n\n### Property Options in Malabar Hill\n\n### Popular Societies with Resale Properties\n\n### 6 BHK for Resale in Nearby Societies\n\n### Popular Localities in Mumbai South\n\n### About Malabar Hill\n\n### List your property\n\n#### Frequently Asked Questions\n\n✅ How is Malab