0;fill;)\n\n## 6 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n*![Location map of 6 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai located at 18.954981, 72.801295](/assets/images/map-icon.png)*\n\n![Location map of 6 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai located at 18.954981, 72.801295](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 69.13 Cr**\n\nThis spacious 6 bedroom unfurnished Flats in Malabar Hill, Mumbai, spans 4548 square feet, presenting a significant opportunity for luxurious living. Situated in one of Mumbai`s most prestigious neighborhoods, this property offers ample space for a large family or for those who enjoy expansive living areas.Malabar Hill is known for its elevated location, offering potential for excellent views and a serene\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/917304971878638990186161319311.png?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n![Lodha Sea Face](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-sea-face-project-project-large-image1-4703.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Lodha Sea Face](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-sea-face-project-apartment-exteriors1-7721.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Lodha Sea Face](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-sea-face-project-floor-plans1-5917.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Lodha Developer Logo]( \"Lodha\")\n\n## 6 BHK Flats in [**Lodha Sea Face**](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-sea-face/237181/project \"Lodha Sea Face\") Worli, Mumbai *Location map of located at 18.996898, 72.812646*\n\n![Location map of  located at 18.996898, 72.812646](/assets/images/map-icon.png)![6 BHK Apartment For Sale in Hill park apartment Malabar Hill, Malabar Hill](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639204993943783109-2407260216341634.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 6 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai *Location map of 6 BHK Flat for